  "historyNote": "#6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 1500); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 3204.04); ss by #10599, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14067, eff 9-3-24",
